{"1994750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Workplace Malice", "steam_appid": 1994750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1994750/extras/a3e1bb7dab659dcf1fd4d7e702e39d4f.poster.avif?t=1788001541\" width=540 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1994750/extras/a3e1bb7dab659dcf1fd4d7e702e39d4f.webm?t=1788001541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1994750/extras/a3e1bb7dab659dcf1fd4d7e702e39d4f.mp4?t=1788001541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1994750/extras/eea5a4ed6b40ad377473caea6b6a18a1.poster.avif?t=1788001541\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1994750/extras/eea5a4ed6b40ad377473caea6b6a18a1.webm?t=1788001541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1994750/extras/eea5a4ed6b40ad377473caea6b6a18a1.mp4?t=1788001541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>When his abusive CEO returns from the dead as something inhuman and unleashes carnage in the office, a burned-out sales rep must survive the night, uncover the truth, and decide how much of his humanity he’s willing to lose.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Workplace Malice is a narrative-driven survival horror set inside the Blue Skyline Office Complex, a towering hub that houses multiple businesses. With its striking HD-2D style, you’ll scavenge resources, solve puzzles, and fight to endure a workplace overrun by inhuman threats. Every choice shifts your morality, shaping the story and unlocking multiple endings. Workplace Malice is a modern, character-driven horror experience that draws from the horrors of everyday life, blending psychological tension with the dread of surviving where you once worked.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1994750/extras/84789e72786f97c6275fb2cb2392287c.avif?t=1788001541\" width=540 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1994750/extras/90e85b9a8bbf9d5d4ff1cdeb55516c9a.poster.avif?t=1788001541\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1994750/extras/90e85b9a8bbf9d5d4ff1cdeb55516c9a.webm?t=1788001541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1994750/extras/90e85b9a8bbf9d5d4ff1cdeb55516c9a.mp4?t=1788001541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Theodore “Theo” Fox returns to his job one week after the mysterious death of his abusive boss, James Krysler. The Blue Skyline Office Complex's exits are suddenly locked, and horror begins when Krysler’s corpse returns, walking the halls. Theo soon realizes the building hides far more than law firms and insurance offices, as its upper floors conceal secrets darker than he could have ever imagined.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1994750/extras/206117606393fd27b4101cc3231251a4.avif?t=1788001541\" width=540 height=100 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1994750/extras/b5511e9901d6d385e182644c96012baa.avif?t=1788001541\" width=540 height=304 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grounded office workers collide with mysterious, otherworldly forces in a tightly woven, character-driven story.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1994750/extras/35d3c3c3bd82546dda16d595feedb447.avif?t=1788001541\" width=540 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1994750/extras/dea666e8dc554214ecd3f23055f8d6de.poster.avif?t=1788001541\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1994750/extras/dea666e8dc554214ecd3f23055f8d6de.webm?t=1788001541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1994750/extras/dea666e8dc554214ecd3f23055f8d6de.mp4?t=1788001541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built as a solo passion project, <i>Workplace Malice</i> fuses exploration, puzzle-solving, and tense combat encounters inspired by classic survival horror. Ammunition and supplies are scarce, forcing you to choose carefully between fighting or hiding from relentless stalker-type enemies that patrol the halls. Explore, backtrack, and unlock new routes with keys, codes, and environmental puzzles while managing limited ammo and healing items, as branching dialogue choices and a morality system shape the narrative and lead to multiple endings.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1994750/extras/5c20d31710b282a6cf5a9fe080daa47a.avif?t=1788001541\" width=540 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1994750/extras/83826d3831481c80446ec0f508e3181b.poster.avif?t=1788001541\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1994750/extras/83826d3831481c80446ec0f508e3181b.webm?t=1788001541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1994750/extras/83826d3831481c80446ec0f508e3181b.mp4?t=1788001541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2D pixel art characters appear in richly lit, cinematic 3D environments that make ordinary office spaces feel both unnerving and visually pleasing. Visually, the game embraces a striking HD-2D presentation, with sprite-animated characters layered into tactile office environments, where copy machines, glass meeting rooms, and carpeted hallways transform into uncanny backdrops for a story that blends modern realism with unsettling nostalgia.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1994750/extras/c02b186a352f96c7115741fdc20a960e.avif?t=1788001541\" width=540 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1994750/extras/f0a5fbc331df92bf0ccb00024127c489.poster.avif?t=1788001541\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1994750/extras/f0a5fbc331df92bf0ccb00024127c489.webm?t=1788001541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1994750/extras/f0a5fbc331df92bf0ccb00024127c489.mp4?t=1788001541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage in tense but rewarding encounters, scavenge for currency, and interact with mysterious merchants who offer supplies at a price.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1994750/extras/c554a0aa67180094d5a7e23e8733ed29.avif?t=1788001541\" width=540 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1994750/extras/f8b2d926293b14adf9aca48d05ebe77d.poster.avif?t=1788001541\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1994750/extras/f8b2d926293b14adf9aca48d05ebe77d.webm?t=1788001541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1994750/extras/f8b2d926293b14adf9aca48d05ebe77d.mp4?t=1788001541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face grotesque monsters and cult figures in battles with multiple phases and escalating spectacle.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1994750/extras/0fa82a8422b128ea2b349096a82b8512.avif?t=1788001541\" width=540 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/199